<title>UK: EIB sets 150 million rand 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 150 million rand 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.0	MATURITY    01.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.45    PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 REOFFER     98.775</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 5-50-500  SALE LIMITS US/UK/SA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   1.675</p>
<p> NOTES	UNCONDITIONAL AND UNSCECURED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
